AS 

User and agent driven rapid software evolution

The code may self optimize
The purpose and design docs as well as legacy decisions made are the guides
Users can click sprout icon bottom right anytime to understand the purpose of the page; to request improvements; or to fork their own - running on the same data, or a new data set
Security and scale is centrally maintained (and continiously improved)
Evolution credit cost can be crowdsourced from user fees or paid outright or executed with coding agents directly
All AS software is automatically accessible by agent scoped APIs so you dont even need to use the interface - just provide your key
Immutable object registry + evolving claims and schema ledger allows the system / UI to be rolled back or replayed at any time (if you have access to the objects themselves)
the realizations can be re-run as technology emerges as goals and contracts are defined  - meaning the software evolves outside and inside
